    body: "More minor fixes rolling out today and tomorrow regarding resume round functionality\n\n**V0.16.11**\n• Leaderboards now have weekly and monthly rankings\n• fixed the UW perk not being saved on resume\n• fixed round playtime not being saved on resume\n• fixed demon mode not resuming if unfinished on resume\n• Tournament button during active rounds not enabling on resume\n• Resume round panel shows tournament tier difficulty correctly\n• A few important background fixes",
