    title: "Hey everyone, v0.21.18 is now available for everyone on iOS and Android",
    body: "Hey everyone, v0.21.18 is now available for everyone on iOS and Android\n\nHeads up for players using emulators. The minimum version of android is now 8.1 Oreo (API Level 27). It was brought to my attention some emulators by default may be on a lower android version, but you can update to a newer version. \n\nWe had to make a lot of backend changes so please report any bugs you find and we will jump on em!",
