    title: "Hotfix v24.4",
    body: "## Hotfix v24.4\nHi, we are releasing another update to fix some issues that we found.\n\n### Bug Fixes\n- Fixed an issue where the new DW labs weren't properly showing for some players\n- Fixed an issue that could happen at the start of the game when trying to check cloud save",
    forwarded: true,
