    body: "# Hotfix v25.6.4\nHello everyone, a new patch is rolling out to adjust some event missions. Update before next event starts to get the reduced requirements.\n\n## Changelog\n- Module merge mission requirements reduced to (10/20/40)\n- If \"Auto Shatter Rare Modules\" from the Harmony Vault is enabled, the module merge mission will autocomplete.\n- Decreased the spotlight mission requirements to (5,000/50,000/500,000)\n- Buy cards is a fixed mission now, not sharing a slot with \"Obtain x modules\" mission.\n- \"Hit x enemies with an ultimate critical\" mission is removed and will not show up anymore from the next event onwards",
