    title: "Hotfix v26.0.5",
    body: "# Hotfix v26.0.5\nA new patch is rolling out to fix some issues!\n- Fixed Project Funding not applying the damage bonus correctly\n- Fixed time issues for event missions, daily missions, lab time and more\n- Anyone stuck in a guild that is non existent anymore should be auto unstuck after opening the guild menu\n- Fixed module max level panel appearing behind the module details panel\n- Fixed issues when purchasing event boost\n- Fixed Tournament button opening the info panel if not touched directly in the icon\n- Menus shouldn't draw over the notch anymore in some Android devices\n\n## Extra Notes:\n- Some players may lose a day in the event login mission because of the time adjustments, we'll adjust that in a future patch before the event ends\n- For now all android devices got the notch adjustment, we'll later improve this to use each specific device safe area",
    forwarded: true,
