    kind: "update",
    title: "V26.2.22 Patch Notes",
    body: "## V26.2.22 Patch Notes\nHello Tower Defenders! A new patch is here with some fixes:\n\n- Improved purchase validation for iOS users\n- Fixed a bug where Intro Sprint stopped after taking damage\n- Improved coin calculations for Fetch chip\n- Fixed the requirements and key costs for T2 node in the Vault's Power Tree\n- Fixed a bug where Fast enemies were not taking thorn damage",
