    kind: "update",
    title: "V26.2.23 Patch Notes",
    body: "# V26.2.23 Patch Notes\nHello everyone, this patch is bringing some change you was waiting some time for:\n\n- Game now adapts to specific devices safe area, so if your device doesn't have a notch, there will be no offset.\n- Tower now is always centered in the available space in the UI (between Perks bar and bottom upgrades), doesn't matter device aspect ratio.\n- Tower is now positioned slightly up in cinematic mode.\n- Fixed an issue that touching the screen in cinematic mode would activate the UI behind sometimes.\n- Bob, the gem block, will now scale up with zoom applied for high range towers, so it is easier to see and tap.\n- fixed an issue in iOS purchases that could not allow to do new purchases.\n\nHave a nice weekend!",
