    body: "## V26.5 Patch Notes\nHi Tower Defenders! Our newest update is rolling out. This update does not feature big gameplay changes, however we have made improvements to our internal systems. These changes will help us deliver an improved cloud save experience to players, while also upgrading our support capabilities:\n- Improved the backend purchasing system\n- Implemented fixes to reduce cloud save rollback issues\n- Improved internal analytics\n\nHappy defending! <:tower:1032170827019456512>",
