    body: "# v26.5.3 Hotfix\n- We made the game allow initialization even when IAP plugin can't start, so those that live in countries with this issue can still play.\n- If you have that issue, remember the [Webstore](https://store.techtreegames.com/thetower/) should still works in this situations.",
