    version: "27.3.3",
    kind: "hotfix",
    title: "Hotfix v27.3.3 - January 12, 2026",
    body: "## Hotfix v27.3.3 - January 12, 2026\n\nHi pals! A small hotfix is rolling out shortly! \n\nAs always, let us know if you see anything or have any questions! \n\n- Added a one-time popup when entering the in-game store reminding players to bookmark the Webstore. (US only)\n- Fixed an issue that could allow unintended free progression in Labs.",
