    body: "## Hotfix 27.4.1 - January 29, 2026 - Gem UI Adjustments \nHi pals! \n\nWe are rolling out a hotfix shortly to update the Gem Pack in-game UI. \n\nWe are currently investigating other reported issues from the latest release and will have another hotfix coming soon, but no exact date as of right now. \n\nIf you experience any other issues, please reach out to Player Support.",
