    title: "Hotfix v27.4.2",
    body: "## Hotfix v27.4.2  \n\nTowerrrrr Defenderrrrrrrrs - *Let’s get readyyyy to HOTFIIIIIIIIIIIX!*\n\nNo seriously, we have Hotfix 27.4.2 rolling out now, and should be out to everyone soon. \n\n**Here’s what’s coming: **\n\n- Summon Chip \n  - Fixed an issue where the Summon Chip of the Guardian was not spawning the expected number of 2 enemies per second. Summon Chip now works as intended. \n- Excessive Disk Writes\n  - Fixed an issue that was causing excessive disk writes on MacOS when running The Tower. \n- Login Mission not incrementing \n  - Fixed an issue where the Login Mission was not incrementing automatically after the event rolled over. We’ve added an extra progression point for all users to this event as compensation.",
