    version: "27.4.3",
    kind: "hotfix",
    title: "Hotfix v27.4.3 Patch Notes",
    body: "## Hotfix v27.4.3 Patch Notes \n\nHi Tower Defenders! Here are the patch notes for today's hotfix! This one has a few UI fixes, some Guild updates, and you can now have your telescope and (visually) Death Defy it too! \n\n## UI\n- Fixed an issue where allowing your run to auto restart while in the run history menu would block access to your daily missions, labs, and event page. \n- Fixed an issue where the value for the Lab Gem Boost would clip out of the information pop up if the language was set to Russian or French. \n- Fixed an issue where the scroll functionality across all menus would become completely frozen when multiple touch inputs were used simultaneously after returning from gameplay. \n\n## Guild\n- Fixed an issue for the Guardian where the cost for the second chip was incorrectly shown as 200 instead of 300. \n- Fixed an issue where respecting the Guardian could refund more resources than intended.\n\n## Other\n- Fixed a visual only issue where the animation for Death Defy was not playing properly if the player had the telescope skin active.",
