    title: "- Damage Decay: Tower Damage is reduced every 10 waves",
    body: "- Damage Decay: Tower Damage is reduced every 10 waves\n- Health Decay: Tower Health is reduced every 10 waves\n- More Fleets: An additional Fleet spawns every 100 waves\n- More Elites: An additional Elite spawns every 5 waves",
    forwarded: false,
